    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "How each one is built",
      "items": [
        "sqrt: Newton's step, x = (x + a/x)/2, from an estimate off the exponent",
        "exp: take out the whole multiples of ln(2), then a series on the remainder",
        "sin: fold the angle into a quarter turn, then a short series"
      ]
